{"id":809081,"title":"14｜Coze工作流详解","content":"创建天气预报助手工作流的过程包括定义节点、配置输入输出以及利用大模型处理自然语言。首先，通过添加工作流并命名，进入编排界面。工作流由多个节点组成，每个节点代表一个功能或操作，如插件或大模型。节点之间通过连线连接，形成从开始到结束的流程。以啤酒生产流水线类比，说明了输入与输出的概念。接着，通过添加“墨迹天气”插件来查询天气，并使用大模型解析用户指令，提取城市和日期信息。大模型作为处理自然语言的关键节点，将非结构化文本转化为标准化参数，传递给天气插件。最终，该工作流能够根据用户提供的自然语言指令自动查询并返回指定城市的天气预报。整个过程强调了工作流设计中逻辑清晰、节点间有效沟通的重要性，确保AI机器人能够智能地响应用户需求。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401468,"user_name":"龙贤","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2078228,"ip_address":"山东","ucode":"AD43E1CC94BE42","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1752214896,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100801301,"comment_content":"测试工作流大模型无法识别日期,  比如  今天天气 昨天天气 今日 明日,  只能识别  比如 , 青岛,2025年6月25日的天气,这样明确带时间的","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1025747,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/a6/d3/856316dd.jpg","nickname":"lester","note":"","ucode":"79BD59B50C97BA","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":673109,"discussion_content":"同问","content_length":6,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1761270448,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397524,"user_name":"Geek_7e22f8","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3834368,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"C52346047A3A2C","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738836872,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100801301,"comment_content":"老师，我为什么怎么设置，工作流都识别不出来日期呢？比如：我输入-北京明天天气怎么样？他不会识别出年月日，只会输出“明天”","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1025747,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/a6/d3/856316dd.jpg","nickname":"lester","note":"","ucode":"79BD59B50C97BA","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":673108,"discussion_content":"也遇到了同样的问题，有的大模型可以，有的大模型不可以。又遇到了另一个问题，可以识别日期的，带深度分析的大模型，相应速度比较慢，这里的问题是，如何选择大模型","content_length":231,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1761269556,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1178402,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/fb/22/a0ddf3ee.jpg","nickname":"see","note":"","ucode":"39D123F84885BE","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668820,"discussion_content":"我的也不行","content_length":5,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1753155968,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":3196256,"avatar":"","nickname":"Geek_03197d","note":"","ucode":"1A4CB405EF154A","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":660511,"discussion_content":"我也遇到了这个问题，怎么都识别不出来明天这个词汇成日期，换了好几个大模型都不行，还望老师指点","content_length":46,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1746664076,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"安徽","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}